# ===== 默认全部忽略，白名单放行（106个BSP占1.3G，只跟踪本项目需要的部分）=====
/*
!/rt-thread-master
/rt-thread-master/*
!/rt-thread-master/rt-thread-master

# --- RT-Thread 内核与公共组件 ---
/rt-thread-master/rt-thread-master/*
!/rt-thread-master/rt-thread-master/bsp
/rt-thread-master/rt-thread-master/bsp/*
!/rt-thread-master/rt-thread-master/bsp/novosns
!/rt-thread-master/rt-thread-master/src
!/rt-thread-master/rt-thread-master/libcpu
!/rt-thread-master/rt-thread-master/include
!/rt-thread-master/rt-thread-master/components
!/rt-thread-master/rt-thread-master/tools
!/rt-thread-master/rt-thread-master/Kconfig
!/rt-thread-master/rt-thread-master/Kconfig.full
!/rt-thread-master/rt-thread-master/Kconfig.short
!/rt-thread-master/rt-thread-master/SConstruct
!/rt-thread-master/rt-thread-master/SConscript
!/rt-thread-master/rt-thread-master/README.md
!/rt-thread-master/rt-thread-master/ChangeLog.md

# ===== 构建产物与本地文件（全局）=====
__pycache__/
*.pyc
build/
*.uvguix.*
.config.old
*.log

# ===== 窄例外（Phase 8-F2d-R3, 用户任务书要求的 GitHub 交付）=====
# 只放行: 本忽略文件自身(让忽略策略可被审查) + 手写主机验证源码 + 轻量审查文本。
# 其余"默认全忽略"与构建产物/隐私禁令原样保留, 不放开 build/ 与日志目录。
!/.gitignore
!/tests/
!/reports/
